      "selection_rationale": "The reported capital-structure plan and cash-flow tension provide a distinct useful current company question. A revenue beat does not answer how expansion is financed or how voting control is preserved. This differs from Tesla spending-versus-expectations, IBM software demand, oil and historical filing/custody explainers. Single Reuters origin, underlying event truth unconfirmed.",
      "source_pack": [
